                                                "sense_id": "5dbaa5fb-c280-3f46-a639-7f7fff1315ea",
                                                "text": "Children are often placed in shopping trolleys; in the designated seats as well as in the trolley itself.\nA fall from a shopping trolley is a regular occurrence, possibly due to diminished attention of the parents while shopping."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3aee7e03-1647-4e3c-8c7b-3f68b9d58cb8",
                                                "sense_id": "5dbaa5fb-c280-3f46-a639-7f7fff1315ea",
                                                "text": "Which payment system and shopping trolley software is right for you?[…]When you go to the supermarket or other retail outlet, you pick goodies off the shelves and put them in a shopping trolley."
                                            }
